I'm sure you'll find him!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.160
Take care!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:07.170
"Castle this way"

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:18.930
"Castle Buns"

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.010
What's this?

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.220
A scrap of paper.

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.930
Doesn't it look like that castle?

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:04.810
You know, the one on the other side of the
mountain that's rumored to have vampires.

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:15.150
Draluc... Are you thinking about
Marusuke--I mean, John again?

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.780
Father, don't worry.
I've already put it behind me.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:20.910
Whoa, this room feels troubled!

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.280
What do you mean, "troubled"?!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:25.790
You've got Mother's portrait on
the lid of your coffin, don't you?!

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:28.200
N-No, that's just...

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:31.210
Good night, my sweet.

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.380
I didn't know you kissed it!
I didn't <i>want </i>to know!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.840
But Mira's always so busy that
I can't see her, so I get lonely!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:41.010
Anyway, I'm fine.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:44.180
Jeez, Father is so overprotective.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:49.060
I'm sure John's having fun where he is.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:20:00.280
No...! Help me!
I'm going to die! Sand!

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:11.500
N-No way... It can't be...

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.250
Joh--

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.760
John!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:22.340
John! What are you doing here?

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.550
Back in South America, you...

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:31.270
John...

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:37.940
I... was an idiot...

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.820
It's boorish to ask
after all this time, but...

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:50.660
John, will you live
with me as my familiar?

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:59.130
And so, John became my familiar,
and we have lived together ever since.

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:05.760
I swore that I would never be
separated from John again.

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:08.510
That's all. What do you think?

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:15.770
So what...? I... I've... gone to
buy donuts... with John before...

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:17.610
Your voice is shaking.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:19.110
Shut up!

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:25.320
But, well, John's really a good
kid who's devoted to you...

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:31.660
That's even more reason you shouldn't
use him as a ball, you scum!

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:09.510
One day, we received word
from the villa caretaker

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.180
that John's parents had been found.

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:16.060
We found out that they were attacked
by a giant vampiric mosquito

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:19.770
and were separated from John,
who was still a baby at the time.

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:34.830
I will take good care of your son.

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.500
A long time has passed since then,

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:45.170
but we are still close with
the armadillos on that hill.
